  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, a reaper faces a choice. Their occult studies have almost completely devoured their soul, and they must choose to reclaim or surrender their soul.</p>\n<p>If the reaper surrenders their soul, they undergo a final transformation listed in the apotheosis ability of their chosen cult. If they instead reclaim their soul, the reaper reasserts their identity and purges the corruption their occult teachings have caused.</p>\n<p>A reclaimed soul causes the reaper to lose all benefits of the cult class feature except for the permanent favored prey gained at 1st level. In exchange, the reaper immediately gains five combat feats of their choice, fast healing 5, and becomes immune to ability damage, ability drain, death effects, and level drain.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/reaper#toc89\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
